  "game": {
    "name": "paintbot-pw",
    "description": "Paintbot in Polyworld: sixteen BASIC or WASM file policies fight over hearts in a deterministic 3D paintball arena.",
    "owner": "daveey",
    "player_runtime": "game-hosted",
    "runnable": {
      "type": "game",
      "image": "{{GAME_IMAGE}}",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/Metta-AI/paintbot-pw",
      "resources": {
        "requests": {
          "cpu": "2",
          "memory": "2Gi"
        },
        "limits": {
          "cpu": "6",
          "memory": "12Gi"
        }
      }
    },
    "config_schema": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "tokens",
        "players",
        "seed",
        "max_ticks"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "tokens": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 16,
          "maxItems": 16,
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          }
        },
        "players": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 16,
          "maxItems": 16,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "name"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "seed": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": -2147483648,
          "maximum": 2147483647
        },
        "max_ticks": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 28800
        },
        "slots": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 16,
          "maxItems": 16,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "team": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "results_schema": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "scores",
        "ticks",
        "seed",
        "outcome"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "scores": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 16,
          "maxItems": 16,
          "items": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 10
          }
        },
        "ticks": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 28800
        },
        "seed": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "outcome": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "banked_gold": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0
          }
        },
        "returned": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "replay_viewer": {
      "bundle": "replay-viewer",
      "replay_compression": "gzip"
    },
    "protocols": {
      "player": {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "Submit one raw BASIC file or Paintbot-CDX ABI WASM reactor. Even slots are Red, odd slots Blue. See the readme for the BASIC API and WASM compatibility contract."
      },
      "global": {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "GET /client/global returns a static status page. /global sends one JSON status message after WebSocket upgrade and echoes Ping frames with Pong. No gameplay traffic uses WebSockets. Other legacy endpoints return explicit stubs."
      }
    },
    "docs": {
      "readme": {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "# Paintbot PW\n\nSixteen wheeled cogs fight on a symmetric Polyworld arena. Red uses even slots;\nBlue uses odd slots. Capture the enemy heart in your home endzone or exhaust the\nother team's lives to win. One capture wins, even if your own heart is stolen.\nEach cog has three lives and three base HP. Death returns a carried heart home,\nloses equipment, and respawns at a fresh endzone position after 72 ticks if lives\nremain. Spawn protection lasts 36 ticks. A time-limit draw gives both teams zero.\n\n## Combat and equipment\n\n- Solid bodies block teammates and opponents. Movement while carrying is 70%.\n- Vision is a 120-degree forward cone with unlimited distance and wall occlusion.\n- Paintball guns lock aim during a five-tick windup, then trace a hitscan ray.\n  Friendly fire is enabled. Shots released together choose targets before damage.\n  Range is 5250 units. The user-selected cadence is one shot per second.\n- Four grenade pickups refill after five seconds. Carry one; hold C to charge up\n  to 24 ticks and release to throw. Grenades fly over walls, land after ten ticks,\n  and deal two damage to every body in the blast, including allies and yourself.\n- Spray cans refill after 30 seconds. A carried can replaces the gun. Fire sends\n  a directional cone for five ticks, with 20 ticks of recovery. Aim locks at the\n  beginning of each burst; each victim takes three damage once per burst.\n- Trenches are walkable pits. Entering is full speed; movement outward is slowed\n  fivefold. Gun cooldown is tripled, and 70% of outside gunfire passes overhead.\n  Shots from inside the same trench and spray ignore that protection. Grenades\n  deal six damage to victims in the landing trench, one to victims in other\n  trenches, and two outside trenches.\n- Shields add three armor HP without healing base HP. Damage consumes armor first.\n  Armor, heart carrying, and trenches slow gunfire threefold without stacking.\n- Med kits restore base HP; healthy cogs leave them. Shields and kits refill in\n  30 seconds. All pickups and other cogs are fog-gated for policies.\n\nThe game runs at 24 deterministic ticks per second. Coordinates use integer\nhundredths of a Polyworld tile on a 6400\u00d74000 arena.\n\n## File policies\n\nSubmit either a UTF-8 BASIC file or a WASM module implementing `paintbot_alloc`,\n`paintbot_buffer`, `paintbot_step`, `paintbot_output_size`, exported memory and\noptional WASI `_initialize`. WASM uses the existing Paintbot sprite protocol:\nmovement, aim buttons, A for gun/spray, C for grenade charge/release. Observations\ninclude fog-gated equipment labels, grenade flights/targets/blasts, spray puffs,\narmor, lives, hearts, and static trench terrain.\n\nBASIC read-only data: `selfId`, `selfTeam`, `selfX`, `selfY`, `selfHp`, `carrying`,\n`homeX`, `homeY`, `heartX`, `heartY`, `ownHeartX`, `ownHeartY`, `ownHeartStolen`,\n`worldTick`, `hasGrenade`, `hasSpray`, `armorHp`, `livesLeft`, `grenadeCharge`,\n`trenchId` (-1 outside).\n\nQueries: `visible(slot)`, `playerX(slot)`, `playerY(slot)`, `playerHp(slot)`,\n`playerCarrying(slot)`, `pickupCount()`, `pickupVisible(id)`, `pickupX(id)`,\n`pickupY(id)`, `pickupKind(id)` (0 grenade, 1 spray, 2 medkit, 3 armor).\nHidden player and pickup coordinates are not disclosed.\n\nActions: `walkTo(x,y)`, `lookAt(x,y)`, `shootAt(x,y)`, `chargeGrenade(held)`.\nRelease by calling `chargeGrenade(0)` or not calling it on the next tick.\n`shout(stringHandle)` is public communication; PRINT remains private.\nSource is limited to 64 KiB, memory to 2 MiB, and each decision to 20,000\ninstructions / 50,000 work units. WASM instances are isolated in the game pod.\n\n## Replays\n\nReplays record accepted actions and per-tick state hashes. Version 6 includes\nall equipment state and the approved Paint Crew cog models. The viewer supports\nseeking, individual cone visibility, first-person view, event filtering, inventory,\narmor/lives inspection, grenade arcs/blasts, spray effects and trench markers.\nEarlier replay versions retain their original rules and hashes.\n"
      }
    }
